 task to your activity. Tasks are the main building blocks of your activity.",placement:"bottom",mask:!0},{id:"task-title",target:'[data-tour="task-title"]',title:"Task Title",description:"Enter a clear and descriptive title for your task. This helps students understand what they need to do.",placement:"right",mask:!0},{id:"task-objective",target:'[data-tour="task-objective"]',title:"Task Objective",description:"Describe the purpose and goals of this task. Be specific about what students should achieve.",placement:"right",mask:!0},{id:"task-schedule",target:'[data-tour="task-schedule"]',title:"Set Schedule",description:"Define when the task starts and when it's due. Students will see this timeline.",placement:"top",mask:!0},{id:"task-next",target:'[data-tour="task-next-button"]',title:"Continue to Settings",description:"Click Next to configure evaluation type and submission settings.",placement:"top",mask:!0}],t3n=[{id:"add-subtask-button",target:'[data-tour="add-subtask-button"]',title:"Add a Subtask",description:"Break down your task into smaller subtasks. This helps organize complex activities.",placement:"bottom",mask:!0},{id:"subtask-inherit",target:'[data-tour="subtask-inherit"]',title:"Inherited Settings",description:"Subtasks inherit settings from the parent task. You can customize them as needed.",placement:"right",mask:!0},{id:"subtask-title",target:'[data-tour="subtask-title"]',title:"Subtask Title",description:"Give your subtask a specific title that describes this part of the activity.",placement:"right",mask:!0}],n3n=[{id:"evaluation-type",target:'[data-tour="evaluation-type"]',title:"Choose Evaluation Type",description:"Select how you want to grade this task: Numeric (marks), Rubric (criteria-based), or Non-Graded.",placement:"right",mask:!0},{id:"marks-config",target:'[data-tour="marks-config"]',title:"Set Marks Range",description:"For numeric evaluation, set the minimum and maximum marks for this task.",placement:"right",mask:!0},{id:"rubric-config"